## Quality Assurance Approach

My contribution focused on ensuring that the team's project documentation was consistent and suitable for final submission.

The QA process included checks for:

* Formatting consistency
* Referencing accuracy
* Table accuracy
* Spelling and grammar
* Version control
* Document integration
* Schedule information

The project documentation review log recorded QA activities across the Scope document, Methodology document, Gantt Chart and Final Report.

