## Key Learning

The project provided practical experience in applying project-management principles within a team-based engineering project environment.

A key learning from my Quality Assurance role was that quality management is not limited to checking a final document. It requires continuous review, consistency between interconnected deliverables, accurate information, effective version control, and coordination between team members.

